  "snp1.4:0.2": "<p><i>This sutta is nearly identical with SN 7:11—“nearly,” because the incident reported here of Kasi’s throwing away the milk-rice, and its sizzling in the water, is not included in that version.</i></p><p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn16'>DN 16</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn7.14'>SN 7:14</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn7.17'>SN 7:17</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.113'>AN 4:113</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thig13.2'>Thig 13:2</a></p>",
